      "widgets_values": [
        "Install **Kandinsky 6** (`kandinsky6`) and **Kandinsky6 SR** (`kandinsky6-sr`) in Manager; restart.\n\nClick **Download models** below (or the **Kandinsky 6** menu). Downloads all weights and JSON configs, including Qwen3.5-9B (~19.3 GB).\n\nEdit the **Beautify** captions; `enabled=false` uses them directly. The expanded prompt appears in **Preview as Text**. Speech goes in the video caption as `<S>words<E>`.\n\nDefault: **Pro distill, 10 steps, CFG=1, audio scaling=0.417**; MagCache bypassed. Ordinary Pro: **50 steps, CFG=5, MagCache steps=50, audio scaling=0.5302**.\n\nSR loader: `2x` for 2x/2.25x; `4x` for 4x. NABLA off by default (`use_nabla=false`). For speed, try `--use-sage-attention` (install SageAttention first).\n\nComfyUI **0.38+** required. For gated/private HF weights, run `hf auth login` on the server."
